{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-warehouse-stock-split","title":"多仓库存与现货可得性拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-factor-rule/multi-warehouse-stock-split","wordCount":2165,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"多仓库存与现货可得性拆分\">多仓库存与现货可得性拆分</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么-有货-不是一个布尔值\">核心概念：为什么&quot;有货&quot;不是一个布尔值</h2><p>买家看到的库存永远是「有货/无货」两态，但履约系统眼里的库存是一个<strong>分仓的、带时间与渠道约束的向量</strong>。同一个 SKU 在洛杉矶仓有 40 件、在新泽西仓有 12 件、在法兰克福仓有 0 件，而订单要发到西雅图——这三条事实组合起来，决定了这张订单能不能不拆、要拆成几单。拆单引擎的第一个输入就是这个向量，而不是一个标量。</p>\n<p>把这个向量变成拆单决策，需要区分三个经常被混为一谈的量：<strong>实物库存</strong>（物理上在货架上的件数）、<strong>已被预占的库存</strong>（其他订单已锁定但未出库的件数）、<strong>净可承诺量</strong>（net available-to-promise，真正还能分给新订单的件数）。这三者的关系是净 ATP = 实物 − 已预占 − 安全库存 + 在途补货（按到货日折算）。拆单引擎只能用净 ATP，用实物库存会导致超卖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[下单请求&lt;br/&gt;行项 × 数量 × 目的地址] --&gt; B[候选仓筛选&lt;br/&gt;可达性/服务范围]&#10;  B --&gt; C[逐仓查询净 ATP]&#10;  C --&gt; D{单仓能否覆盖&lt;br/&gt;全部行项?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[不拆单&lt;br/&gt;整单路由到该仓]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[计算最小覆盖集合&lt;br/&gt;set cover]&#10;  F --&gt; G[候选拆法集合]&#10;  G --&gt; H[交给优化器&lt;br/&gt;见 第二章]\">graph TD\n  A[下单请求&lt;br/&gt;行项 × 数量 × 目的地址] --&gt; B[候选仓筛选&lt;br/&gt;可达性/服务范围]\n  B --&gt; C[逐仓查询净 ATP]\n  C --&gt; D{单仓能否覆盖&lt;br/&gt;全部行项?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[不拆单&lt;br/&gt;整单路由到该仓]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[计算最小覆盖集合&lt;br/&gt;set cover]\n  F --&gt; G[候选拆法集合]\n  G --&gt; H[交给优化器&lt;br/&gt;见 第二章]</pre><h2 id=\"净-atp-的精确口径\">净 ATP 的精确口径</h2><h3 id=\"分仓-atp-的计算公式\">分仓 ATP 的计算公式</h3><p>设仓 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 中 SKU <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的实物库存为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O_{i,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，已预占量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{i,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，安全库存为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{i,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，未来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 天内到货的在途量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{i,s}(\\Delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则面向承诺窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的净可承诺量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>O</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{i,s}(\\Delta) = O_{i,s} - R_{i,s} - S_{i,s} + I_{i,s}(\\Delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子最容易被误用的是最后一项。在途库存<strong>不能无条件计入</strong>：如果一辆卡车三天后到仓，那么今天下单、承诺次日达的订单不能动用它，而承诺七天后达的订单可以。所以 ATP 必须带一个时间参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，它是「承诺时效窗口」而不是「现在」。这也是为什么<strong>购前展示给买家的 ATP</strong> 与<strong>购后拆单用的 ATP</strong> 必须用不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>：前者对应买家看到的预计到达日（其口径由承诺展示域拥有，本 hub 不定义），后者对应实际的仓内出库能力。把两者混用会让拆单引擎按「买家看到的日期」去判断仓内能不能出库，旺季时会产生大量无法兑现的拆单方案。</p>\n<p>安全库存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{i,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在拆单语境下的取值是一个治理问题而非数学问题。它通常由补货策略给出（服务水平对应的分位数 × 需求标准差），但拆单引擎需要知道一件事：<strong>什么情况下允许透支安全库存</strong>。常见做法是给订单打优先级——高价值会员或已有延迟的订单允许占用安全库存，普通订单不允许。把这条件写进 ATP 查询而不是写进硬编码逻辑，是可解释性的前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"库存查询的三种一致性问题\">库存查询的三种一致性问题</h3><p>拆单引擎查 ATP 时面对的是<strong>一个可能正在被其他订单修改的数据集</strong>。三种典型问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>脏读导致的超卖</td>\n<td>读到未提交的预留，扣了别人的货</td>\n<td>只读已提交快照；预留与读在同一事务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询后失效（TOCTOU）</td>\n<td>查到有货，落预留时已被抢空</td>\n<td>预留操作必须带条件更新并检查影响行数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨仓非原子</td>\n<td>仓 A 预留成功、仓 B 失败</td>\n<td>预留带事务 ID，失败时全量回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二种是最常见的。天真的写法是「先 <code>SELECT</code> 判断够不够，再 <code>UPDATE</code> 扣减」，两个并发请求会都通过判断然后都扣减。正确的写法是把判断压进更新的条件里，让数据库的行锁替你串行化——示意如下（PostgreSQL 语义）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE stock_allocation&#10;SET reserved_qty = reserved_qty + $1&#10;WHERE warehouse_id = $2&#10;  AND sku_id = $3&#10;  AND (on_hand_qty - reserved_qty - safety_qty) &gt;= $1&#10;RETURNING reserved_qty;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_allocation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (on_hand_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> safety_qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING reserved_qty;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若返回 0 行，说明条件不成立——货不够，而不是发生了错误。这里必须区分「条件不满足」与「数据库异常」，前者走换仓或拆单，后者走重试。这个区分看似琐碎，但把二者混为一谈的系统会在库存紧张时疯狂重试，把数据库打垮。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事务隔离级别的选择\">事务隔离级别的选择</h3><p>上一条依赖数据库给出行级串行化。PostgreSQL 的默认隔离级别是 <code>READ COMMITTED</code>，在该级别下并发的 <code>UPDATE</code> 会等待持有行锁的事务提交，然后在新版本上重新求值 <code>WHERE</code> 条件，因此上面那条语句是安全的（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/transaction-iso.html\">PostgreSQL 事务隔离</a>）。如果换到 <code>REPEATABLE READ</code>，冲突的更新不会等待并重求值，而是直接返回序列化失败（SQLSTATE <code>40001</code>），应用必须整体重试。</p>\n<p>对拆单引擎来说，<code>REPEATABLE READ</code> 反而是更好的选择，原因不是它更强，而是它<strong>让失败显式化</strong>：跨多个仓的预留如果分散在多次快照里，可能出现「每个仓单独看都合法，合起来超卖」的幻读型异常。代价是应用层必须实现重试，且重试要重新走整个拆单决策（因为库存已变，原来的最优拆法可能不再合法）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多仓覆盖-从向量到拆分方案\">多仓覆盖：从向量到拆分方案</h2><h3 id=\"最小覆盖集合问题\">最小覆盖集合问题</h3><p>「用最少的仓覆盖全部行项」是一个经典的<strong>集合覆盖问题</strong>（set cover）：每个候选仓是一个集合，元素是它能供应的行项。求最小仓数是 NP-hard 的，但拆单场景的规模极小——通常不超过 5 个候选仓、不超过 30 个行项——所以实践中可以精确求解或直接枚举。</p>\n<p>贪心的近似解是「每次选能覆盖最多未覆盖行项的仓」，其近似比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(n) = \\sum_{k=1}^{n} 1/k \\approx \\ln n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 的场景误差已经无关紧要。真正的工程问题不是近似比，而是<strong>并列时的取舍</strong>：两个仓都能覆盖同样多的行项时选谁？答案不能只看覆盖数，要看第二章的完整目标函数（运费、时效、后续拆单倾向），所以这里只产出候选集合，把择优交给优化器。</p>\n<h3 id=\"现货可得性的分级\">现货可得性的分级</h3><p>实践中「有货」应细分为几级，因为不同级别触发的下游动作不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>拆单动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量现货</td>\n<td>单仓 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{i,s} \\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 需求量</td>\n<td>不拆，整单路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨仓可凑齐</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i A_{i,s} \\ge</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 需求量</td>\n<td>按覆盖集合拆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需在途补货</td>\n<td>现货不足但在途可在承诺窗口内到货</td>\n<td>拆出「延后发」子单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短期缺货</td>\n<td>全部来源都不足</td>\n<td>触发缺货策略（见 <a href=\"../split-fulfillment-ops/split-rebalance-stockout\">缺货时拆单再平衡</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三级是跨境场景特有的，也是最多争议的。如果一件商品需要在途到货后才能发，系统面临的是<strong>拆单还是等待</strong>：把已到货的商品先发一单（拆单，多付一次运费），还是等全部到齐一起发（不拆，但承诺时效可能已经超了）。这个决策的答案取决于件数、单价、买家地址的时效敏感度，落在第二章的目标权衡里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个可落地的候选拆法结构\">一个可落地的候选拆法结构</h3><p>拆单引擎算出的中间产物通常长这样——注意它不是最终答案，而是给优化器的输入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;SO-2026-0912-7731&quot;,&#10;  &quot;destination&quot;: { &quot;country&quot;: &quot;US&quot;, &quot;postal_prefix&quot;: &quot;98&quot; },&#10;  &quot;promise_window_days&quot;: 5,&#10;  &quot;candidates&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;plan_id&quot;: &quot;P1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;shipments&quot;: [&#10;        { &quot;warehouse&quot;: &quot;US-LAX-01&quot;, &quot;lines&quot;: [{ &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 2 }], &quot;atp_ok&quot;: true },&#10;        { &quot;warehouse&quot;: &quot;US-EWR-02&quot;, &quot;lines&quot;: [{ &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 1 }], &quot;atp_ok&quot;: true }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;hard_constraints_ok&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;est_freight&quot;: 14.2,&#10;      &quot;est_transit_p90&quot;: 3&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;plan_id&quot;: &quot;P2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;shipments&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;warehouse&quot;: &quot;US-LAX-01&quot;,&#10;          &quot;lines&quot;: [&#10;            { &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 2 },&#10;            { &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 1 }&#10;          ],&#10;          &quot;atp_ok&quot;: false&#10;        }&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;hard_constraints_ok&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;est_freight&quot;: 8.6,&#10;      &quot;est_transit_p90&quot;: 4,&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;B 需在途补货，出库最早 T+3&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SO-2026-0912-7731\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"destination\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"postal_prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"98\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"promise_window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"candidates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"plan_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"shipments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-LAX-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"atp_ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-EWR-02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"atp_ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hard_constraints_ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"est_freight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"est_transit_p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"plan_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"shipments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US-LAX-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"atp_ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hard_constraints_ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"est_freight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"est_transit_p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B 需在途补货，出库最早 T+3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>hard_constraints_ok</code> 是第一章的核心分界：只有它为真的候选才进入优化。一个常见的实现缺陷是把「B 需在途补货」表达成一个很高的成本惩罚，而不是一个时间可行性标记——这样做在库存紧张时会让优化器选出「承诺次日达但实际发不出」的方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拆单的第一个输入是<strong>分仓净 ATP 向量</strong>，不是「有货/无货」标量。净 ATP = 实物 − 已预占 − 安全库存 + 窗口内在途。</li>\n<li>ATP 必须带<strong>承诺窗口参数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，在途库存只在窗口内可计入。</li>\n<li>库存预占必须用<strong>条件更新 + 检查影响行数</strong>实现，不能先查后改；并注意隔离级别决定了失败是「等待重试」还是「序列化错误」。</li>\n<li>多仓覆盖是<strong>集合覆盖</strong>问题，规模小可精确求解；引擎此处只产出候选拆法集合，择优属于第二章。</li>\n<li>现货可得性应分级（全量 / 跨仓 / 在途 / 缺货），级别决定下游动作，而不是笼统地记为一个成本项。</li>\n<li>这一篇定义的口径是全书公共语言：第二章的目标函数、第三章的预留模型、第四章的再平衡都以它为基准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多仓库存与现货可得性拆分","id":"多仓库存与现货可得性拆分"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么\"有货\"不是一个布尔值","id":"核心概念-为什么-有货-不是一个布尔值"},{"level":2,"text":"净 ATP 的精确口径","id":"净-atp-的精确口径"},{"level":3,"text":"分仓 ATP 的计算公式","id":"分仓-atp-的计算公式"},{"level":3,"text":"库存查询的三种一致性问题","id":"库存查询的三种一致性问题"},{"level":3,"text":"事务隔离级别的选择","id":"事务隔离级别的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"多仓覆盖：从向量到拆分方案","id":"多仓覆盖-从向量到拆分方案"},{"level":3,"text":"最小覆盖集合问题","id":"最小覆盖集合问题"},{"level":3,"text":"现货可得性的分级","id":"现货可得性的分级"},{"level":3,"text":"一个可落地的候选拆法结构","id":"一个可落地的候选拆法结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"重量体积/特货/清关主体拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-factor-rule/weight-dg-customs-split"}}